Package: ootput
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6
Description: TERMINFO QUERY
 Zero-dependency terminfo querying for terminal capabilities, colors, and cursor movements.
 Capability-bounded openOODA utility with zero ambient authority,
 oote theme palettes, and native Model Context Protocol (MCP) surface.
